IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sda-property`

-- Stamp Duties Act 1929, First Schedule Article 3(a)(iv), (bg), (bi), (bj), (c) -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_sda.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

