§ `Article 8 and Third Schedule Article 4 -- REQ-0008`

-- REQ-0008: 2400 x 24 = 57,600; 0.4% = 230.40, rounded down to 230. Paid by the lessee.
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `the REQ-0008 tenancy: two years at 2400 a month` EQUALS 230
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `a three-year lease at 3000 a month` EQUALS 432
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `a five-year lease at 3000 a month` EQUALS 576
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `an indefinite lease at 1000 a month` EQUALS 192
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `a room at 80 a month for a year` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `a direct HDB public rental flat` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the stamp duty on the lease` `a two-month let at 100 a month` EQUALS 1

#ASSERT `the lease is exempt` `a room at 80 a month for a year`
#ASSERT `the lease is exempt` `a direct HDB public rental flat`
#ASSERT NOT `the lease is exempt` `the REQ-0008 tenancy: two years at 2400 a month`

#ASSERT `who pays the duty on a lease`  EQUALS "the lessee"

